  RowBox[{"\"\<A breathtaking panoramic landscape scene of a golden sunset \
sinking behind distant mountain ranges, with warm orange, pink and purple sky \
gradients reflecting on clouds. In the exact center of the image, display the \
Japanese text '\:300c\:8a08\:7b97\:3068\:81ea\:7136\:300d\:96c6\:4f1a' in \
elegant white font with a subtle dark shadow for readability, styled like a \
